                        WSV bears no ordinal (H: 176,046)              unlock preserved; no
                                                                      relationship-type work
                                                                      assigned; H unchanged
                277     E relationship type definitions; Val: evidence-for,
                        contradicts, supersedes (H: 276,080)           the structure its Records
                                                                      conform to; E's types and
                                                                      application not authored
